#NEXUS

[ wu2015_pone_fig2: Swallowtail phylogeny, 40 tips, one polytomy: six lineages of subgenera Achilides, Eleppone, Princeps, Menelaides and Papilio leave one node. Tip names keep the printed form 'P. (Subgenus) species' as P._Subgenus_species (brackets dropped for Newick). Outside-corpus case: chosen to test whether the tool generalises beyond dinosaur figures, not drawn at random. Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node; topology only. ]

